1.1.0
  The elite system and A-Life Ratio
    The elites of 1.0.0 now have 10 levels, and A-Life Ratio balances the simulation between your map and the rest.

  - Added the elite system. An elite restocks the best armor-piercing ammo for his weapon and grenades, and his rank raises his accuracy.
  - Added A-Life Ratio, a slider for the split of events between your map and the rest.
  - Fixed elitekill_targeted never firing, and the tone of the PDA messages.

