1.0.0
  The first release of an event-driven A-Life
    AlifePlus turns engine events into squad reactions and world drives, with every cause and consequence in the MCM.

  - Added the reactive causes, massacre, squadkill, basekill, elite, legend, legendkill, wounded and harvest.
  - Added the radiant causes, stash and area.
  - Added the chase API, area conquest, hit modifiers and the rank boost.
